en:
Shredders... like we in the lab made a Gauss gun) 
Needed:
- plastic pen with cut-off ends;
- copper wire (insulated);
- screwdriver (you're not gonna wind the wire on the pen by hand, right?));
- 12 volt, 7 amp-hour battery from a UPS;
- screwdriver, we used a watchmaker's one, so it fits inside the pen (metal).
How it works:
- wind the wire on the pen (on the middle 1/3 of the pen);
- solder one end of the wire to the battery, leave the other free;
- insert the screwdriver into the pen, not all the way, so one edge visually reaches the start of the winding;
- SHARPLY touch and release the second battery terminal with the other end of the wire).

